\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. JESUS, where'er Thy people 
\par meet
\par There they behold Thy mercy-seat;
\par Where'er they seek Thee Thou art 
\par found,
\par And every place is hallowed ground.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. For Thou, within no walls 
\par confined,
\par Inhabitest the humble mind;
\par Such ever bing Thee where 
\par they come,
\par And going take Thee to their home.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Dear shepherd of Thy chosen 
\par few,
\par Thy former mercies here renew;
\par Here to our waiting hearts proclaim
\par The sweetness of  Thy saving 
\par name.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Here may we prove the power 
\par of prayer,
\par To strengthen faith and sweeten 
\par care,
\par To teach our faint desires to rise,
\par And bring all heavens before our 
\par eyes.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Lord we are few, but Thou art near
\par Nor short Thine arm, nor deaf Thine ear;
\par O rend the heavens, come quickly down,
\par And make a thousand hearts Thine own.
\par                                       AMEN.
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

